      "content": "Combining the deterministic nature of the DLE with some adaptive elements may bridge the gap. For instance, incorporating strong, rule-based input sanitization coupled with modular reasoning units might allow for a more complex handling of tasks without compromising determinism. This approach utilizes decision trees for structured logic but wraps them with heuristic processing that can deal with more nuanced situations. If such a blend is above your technical capacity, another option could be a companion AI that can queue the more complex tasks to human operators for review, maintaining overall deterministic workflow for simpler tasks while preserving the flexibility needed for complex syntheses. These ideas would require close collaboration with your technical team, and we could continue brainstorming more solutions.",
